<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37781" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐόλει</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>caused to waver,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ δέ νιν οὐκ ἐόλει</span>
				(3sg.
			impf.), as Böckh for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰόλλει</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.233
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐόλητο</span>
				(3sg.
			plpf.) <i>was troubled,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐόλητο νόον μελεδήμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.471
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐόλητο θυμὸν . . ὑποδμηθεὶς βελέεσσι
					Κύπριδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					2.74
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐόληται: τετάρακται,
				ἐπτόηται, ὠδύνηται,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (Perh. cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴλω.</span>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
